WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:10.750
AI log: every AI reply with its source, tools, checks, time and cost, so you can see why the assistant said what it said.

2
00:00:11.296 --> 00:00:18.600
At the top: today's replies, the average time, "Cost today", and the replies the checks stopped.

3
00:00:19.153 --> 00:00:29.670
Click a row to open "Why did the assistant say this?": the customer's message, the knowledge found, the tools, the checks and the reply sent.

4
00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:39.460
Replies that the safety checks changed are in the "Corrected" and "Safe reply + handoff" boxes. These boxes come first on the page and are open.

5
00:00:40.015 --> 00:00:47.560
If a reply came from wrong knowledge, fix the text in "Content & pricing"; the log itself changes nothing.
